wasan perlintasan semakin optimal serta dapat meningkatkan keselamatan dan ketertiban bagi seluruh pengguna jalan.","post_time":1791891457,"owner":"71707671946","username":"bid.angkutandanterminal","comment_count":4,"like_count":178,"cdn_image":"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/71707671946/DebtsiUtm1a.jpg"},{"current_url":"https://www.instagram.com/dishubbekasikota/?_showcaption=true","snapshot_date":1792004968211,"id":"DeeE_vmz1nD","image":"https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/843264524_17937871260391947_2563169102280016835_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=NDAwNzY2MjY5MTAzNjM4Nzc3OTE3OTM3ODcxMjU3MzkxOTQ3.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEzMjAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX3VzZXJfc2VsZWN0ZWRfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=NQ_UwLQqjrMQ7kNvwHBnkUe&_nc_oc=Adoz42PpjFJAVDqFfM9rnb7TSMwshHbqqvi1kPsWEPXKJGvimw94YqUdH4ySjFddIEA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=okMIb2k_k3_Y8M4OpsYD4Q&_nc_ss=7e6a8&oh=00_AQM6A6__1RwZ6vWZEHnUdbFo8JAZ1HVzD75_DzCCBnk8wg&oe=6AD5A24B","caption":"🚌 Petualangan Sahabat Cilik TK Nurul Iman Al Choir! \n\nHari ini adik-adik dari TK Nurul Iman Al Choir berkesempatan mengikuti kegiatan Edutrip / Edukasi Transportasi bersama Dinas Perhubungan Kota Bekasi! 🚦🎈  \n\nBukan cuma jalan-jalan seru, teman-teman kecil kita juga belajar mengenal moda transportasi umum, aturan berlalu lintas, hingga pengalaman seru naik Trans Beken.\n\nBangga sekali melihat semangat anak-anak hari ini. Sampai jumpa di petualangan seru berikutnya! 🎒 \n\n#TKNurulImanAlChoir #TransBeken #EdukasiAnak #AnakTK #belajarlalulintas","post_time":1791970698,"owner":"71707671946","username":"bid.angkutandanterminal","comment_count":4,"like_count":37,"cdn_image":"//cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pemkotbekasi/photo_gallery/picture/71707671946/DeeE_vmz1nD.jpg"},{"current_url":"https://www.instagram.com/dishubbekasikota/?_showcaption=true","snapshot_date":1792004968211,"id":"Ded4kSUEgr7","image":"https: